# `constitution regen` renders constitution/constitution.md from the ADR
# log (M1 DoD happy path): rule-bearing active ADRs render grouped by
# category; a record-only active ADR and a deprecated ADR are both excluded
# from the projection (plan §2.12).

exec constitution regen
stdout 'wrote .*constitution.constitution\.md'
! stderr .

exists constitution/constitution.md
cmp constitution/constitution.md want-constitution.md

-- constitution.yml --
schemaVersion: 1
categories:
  - architecture
  - process

-- constitution/adr/ADR-0001-use-event-sourcing.md --
---
id: ADR-0001
title: Model the constitution as an event-sourced ADR log
category: architecture
date: 2026-07-01
status: accepted
---

## Context and Problem Statement

Need a source of truth that supports supersede/deprecate semantics.

## Considered Options

- Hand-edit constitution.md
- Event-sourced ADR log

## Decision Outcome

Model the constitution as a projection of an append-only ADR log.

## Rule

Model the constitution as a projection of an append-only ADR log; never
hand-edit constitution.md.

-- constitution/adr/ADR-0002-old-process-rule.md --
---
id: ADR-0002
