## Decision Outcome

This rule no longer applies.

-- want-constitution.md --
<!--
  GENERATED FILE -- projection of the ADR log in constitution/adr/.
  Do not hand-edit; changes will be overwritten by the next "constitution
  regen". Only rule-bearing (## Rule) active ADRs project here; to change a
  rule, add, supersede, or deprecate an ADR instead.
-->

# Constitution

## architecture

### Model the constitution as an event-sourced ADR log

Model the constitution as a projection of an append-only ADR log; never
hand-edit constitution.md.

ADR-0001 · 2026-07-01
